VulInstruct

The MIT license in LICENSE covers author-owned implementation, prompts,
documentation, tests and synthetic fixtures. It does not relicense third-party
benchmark code, datasets, advisory references, model weights or dependencies.
Original code comments and dataset text are preserved as research inputs.

Included sources and attribution:

- VulInstruct paper inputs:
  https://doi.org/10.1145/3808132
  https://github.com/zhuhaopku/VulInstruct
  The paper PrimeVul evaluation set is included. Data source hashes and
  transformations are recorded in data/MANIFEST.json and docs/DATA.md.
- CORRECT dataset:
  Everything You Wanted to Know About LLM-based Vulnerability Detection
  But Were Afraid to Ask, Yue Li et al.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.13474
  Source dataset for the general security specification library. VulInstruct
  extracts specifications and vulnerability/fix analyses from its paired code
  and supporting evidence. Embedded code retains its original project terms.
- VulInstruct specification library derived from CORRECT:
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/hzhu721/vulnerability-specifications
  The dataset card declares Apache-2.0; see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
  The release includes correct-specifications.json and the prepared
  correct-specifications-train.json corpus, with their retrieval vectors.
- PrimeVul: https://github.com/DLVulDet/PrimeVul
  Upstream repository license: MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 DLVulDet.
  See LICENSES/PrimeVul-MIT.txt. Embedded code retains the terms of its
  original projects; repository, file and commit identities are preserved.
- SVEN: https://github.com/eth-sri/sven
  Upstream license: MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 SRI Lab, ETH Zurich.
  See LICENSES/SVEN-MIT.txt. Embedded source snippets retain their original
  project terms and commit references.
- NVD: https://nvd.nist.gov/
  This product uses data from the NVD API but is not endorsed or certified by the NVD.
  Referenced advisories and source code retain their respective rights.
- Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B:
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
  Precomputed knowledge vectors are included. Model weights are downloaded
  separately and retain the model's own license.
